      {"id":"el-mit-genethlia","thema":"prosklisi","rahmen":{"de":"Eine Nachricht im Gruppenchat unter Freunden.","es":"Un mensaje en el grupo de amigos.","en":"A message in a friends' group chat."},"texto":"Γεια σας! Το Σάββατο κλείνω τα τριάντα και κάνω ένα πάρτι στην ταράτσα μου, από τις 9 το βράδυ. Φέρτε μόνο καλή διάθεση, τα ποτά τα έχω εγώ! Πείτε μου μέχρι την Πέμπτη αν έρχεστε. Νίκος","bruecke":null,"lautschrift":"Ya sas! To Sávato klíno ta triánda ke káno éna párti stin tarátsa mou, apó tis enniá to vrádi. Férte móno kalí diáthesi, ta potá ta écho egó! Píte mou méchri tin Pémpti an érchesthe. Níkos","aufgaben":[{"typ":"mc","frage":"Πού είναι το πάρτι;","optionen":["Στην ταράτσα του Νίκου","Σε μια ταβέρνα","Στο σπίτι των γονιών του"],"loesung":0,"erklaerung":"«κάνω ένα πάρτι στην ταράτσα μου»."},{"typ":"orden","frage":{"de":"Ordne den Satz.","es":"Ordena la frase.","en":"Put the sentence in order."},"teile":["τα τριάντα","Το Σάββατο","κλείνω"],"loesung":[1,2,0]},{"typ":"frei","frage":{"de":"Antworte Nikos: Kommst du? Was bringst du mit? Schreib deine Antwort.","es":"Contesta a Nikos: ¿vas? ¿Qué llevas? Escribe tu respuesta.","en":"Reply to Nikos: are you coming? What will you bring? Write your answer."}}],"glossar":{"γεια":{"de":"hallo","es":"hola","en":"hi"},"σας":{"de":"euch","es":"(a) vosotros","en":"(to) you all"},"το":{"de":"am (das)","es":"el","en":"on the, the"},"σάββατο":{"de":"Samstag","es":"sábado","en":"Saturday"},"κλείνω":{"de":"ich werde (Alter), ich schließe","es":"cumplo, cierro","en":"I turn (age), I close"},"τα":{"de":"die","es":"los","en":"the"},"τριάντα":{"de":"dreißig","es":"treinta","en":"thirty"},"και":{"de":"und","es":"y","en":"and"},"κάνω":{"de":"ich mache","es":"hago","en":"I'm having, I do"},"ένα":{"de":"eine","es":"una","en":"a"},"πάρτι":{"de":"Party","es":"fiesta","en":"party"},"στην":{"de":"auf der","es":"en la","en":"on the"},"ταράτσα":{"de":"Dachterrasse","es":"azotea","en":"roof terrace"},"μου":{"de":"mein(e), mir","es":"mi, me","en":"my, me"},"από":{"de":"ab","es":"desde","en":"from"},"τις":{"de":"(die) Uhr","es":"las","en":"(the)"},"βράδυ":{"de":"Abend","es":"noche","en":"evening"},"φέρτε":{"de":"bringt","es":"traed","en":"bring"},"μόνο":{"de":"nur","es":"solo","en":"only"},"καλή":{"de":"gute","es":"buen","en":"good"},"διάθεση":{"de":"Laune","es":"humor","en":"mood"},"ποτά":{"de":"Getränke","es":"bebidas","en":"drinks"},"έχω":{"de":"ich habe","es":"tengo","en":"I have"},"εγώ":{"de":"ich","es":"yo","en":"I"},"πείτε":{"de":"sagt","es":"decid","en":"tell"},"μέχρι":{"de":"bis","es":"hasta","en":"by, until"},"την":{"de":"(den)","es":"el","en":"(the)"},"πέμπτη":{"de":"Donnerstag","es":"jueves","en":"Thursday"},"αν":{"de":"ob","es":"si","en":"if"},"έρχεστε":{"de":"ihr kommt","es":"venís","en":"you're coming"},"νίκος":{"de":"Nikos","es":"Nikos (Nicolás)","en":"Nikos (Nick)"}},"schluss":{"de":"Einladung verstanden — jetzt fehlt nur noch deine Zusage.","es":"Invitación entendida; solo falta que confirmes.","en":"Invitation understood — now it just needs your reply."}}
